# Squares, Cubes, and Roots Reference

A quick-reference chart for perfect squares, perfect cubes, and their roots.

---

## Squares and Square Roots (1 to 20)

| Number | Multiplication | Power | Square Root |
| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |
| 1 | $1 \times 1 = 1$ | $1^2 = 1$ | $\sqrt{1} = 1$ |
| 2 | $2 \times 2 = 4$ | $2^2 = 4$ | $\sqrt{4} = 2$ |
| 3 | $3 \times 3 = 9$ | $3^2 = 9$ | $\sqrt{9} = 3$ |
