| 7 | $7 \times 7 = 49$ | $7^2 = 49$ | $\sqrt{49} = 7$ |
| 8 | $8 \times 8 = 64$ | $8^2 = 64$ | $\sqrt{64} = 8$ |
| 9 | $9 \times 9 = 81$ | $9^2 = 81$ | $\sqrt{81} = 9$ |
| 10 | $10 \times 10 = 100$ | $10^2 = 100$ | $\sqrt{100} = 10$ |
| 11 | $11 \times 11 = 121$ | $11^2 = 121$ | $\sqrt{121} = 11$ |
| 12 | $12 \times 12 = 144$ | $12^2 = 144$ | $\sqrt{144} = 12$ |
